b07_return: (89 560.00 DUK, 74 514.00 DUK, 5 787.00 DUK, 5 791.00 DUK, 4.00 DUK)
  assumed: October's gross is B-D25's 7 200.00 or more (the net is above B-D25's) (gross_lo)
  assumed: a bonus month's gross searched up to 20 000.00 DUK (gross_hi)
  pinned: ola_gross[2024-10] = 10 360.00 DUK
  pinned: ola_gross[m] = g for g in gross_lo .. gross_hi step minor(DUK) where ola_net[m] as if {ola_gross[m] = g} >= observed(mewa_pay[m]).cash.amount, m in months
  law date 2025-04-30, cut 2025-04-30
